<tr><th>Concept</th><th>Meaning in this lecture</th></tr>
<tr><td>interface</td><td>don’t know implementation; only requirement specification (the plan)</td></tr>
<tr><td>abstract class</td><td>talking about implementation, but not completely (partially completed building)</td></tr>
<tr><td>concrete class</td><td>complete implementation and ready to provide service (fully completed building, ready to use)</td></tr>
